Registry:
To login to registry:
docker login dockerhub.io ie url
Will ask for user name and password. 

We have other registery like azure, git, gcp etc.

We can create our own registry
For this need to pull image called registry:2
docker run -d -p 5000:5000 --name registry registry:2 - Will create own registry always it will run on port 5000
docker image tag myimage localhost:5000/myimage - Step1 to push image
docker push  localhost:5000/myimage - step2 to push image
docker pull  localhost:5000/myimage - step3 to pull image

To remove all the image on the system
docker images prune
To list all the images
docker image ls

To stop the conatiner ie registry container
docker container stop my-registry
To remove the conatiner ie registry container
docker container rm my-registry